.subckt sampling_feedback_ota vss iref vdd vinn vinp vocm voutn voutp
* Differential voltage amplifier with internal reference and continuous CM control.
RREF iref vss 100k
X1 a vinp t vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=8
X2 b vinn t vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=80 nf=8
XT t vb vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=1 w=80 nf=8
X3 a a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=80 nf=8
X4 b a vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=1 w=80 nf=8
* output stage
XP1 voutp vb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=160 nf=16
XP2 voutn vb vdd vdd sky130_fd_pr__pfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=160 nf=16
XN1 voutp a vss vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=160 nf=16
XN2 voutn b vss sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.5 w=160 nf=16
RB1 vdd vb 20k
RB2 vb vss 20k
RCP voutp cm 100k
RCN voutn cm 100k
RCM cm vocm 100k
.ends sampling_feedback_ota
